SUMMARY:June First Friday Markets & Makers at Ewell Plaza with PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Join us for another Markets & Makers with the City of Lancaster for June First Friday! Join the PCA&D Center for Creative Exploration and our community partners in Ewell Plaza on Friday\, June 5  from 5 – 8 pm where PCA&D’s Center for Creative Exploration will be hosting fun\, recycled bug making and Lancaster Creative Factory invites you to make 2-D mini collages and model magic pinch pots while you watch live clay wheel-throwing! All projects are for all ages and free! So stop by\, make art\, learn more about these amazing organizations\, and most importantly – HAVE FUN & MAKE ART! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
