SUMMARY:Lancaster VegFest
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 10th annual Lancaster VegFest!\nSaturday\, June 6th\, 12 pm – 5 pm\nSunday\, June 7th\, 12 pm – 5 pm\nLancaster VegFest is a FREE public event with a mission to provide information about the benefits of a plant-based lifestyle for health\, the environment\, and animals while having FUN! The event will include OVER 100 VENDORS\, a beer garden\, speakers\, vegan food\, entertainment\, raffle prizes\, children’s activities\, non-profit organizations\, and much\, much more!\nSupport Lancaster Farm Sanctuary with a $5 suggested donation at the door.\nLearn more at http://pavegfest.com/\n\nVIP Tickets: VIPs get a FANTASTIC goodie bag and an exclusive hour to the event from 11-12!!!\n⭐️ 11a-12p exclusive access to the event\n⭐️ NEW: Exclusive all-day VIP line at Vegan Treats\n⭐️ A limited-edition 2026 festival reusable tote bag\n⭐️ Incredible Vegan Samples & Coupons from participating sponsors\n⭐️ 10 raffle tickets\nGet Your VIP Tickets Here: https://events.ticketleap.com/tickets/lancaster-vegfest/lancaster-vegfest-2026-vip-ticket \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-vegfest-2/2026-06-06/
LOCATION:Buchanan Park\, 901 Buchanan Avenue\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/VegFest-Slide.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster VegFest":MAILTO:pavegfest@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
