SUMMARY:Critique Club
DESCRIPTION:Critique Club is a welcoming space for artists of all levels — from beginners to established professionals — to bring in their artwork for feedback and discussion. The club is not just about receiving critique; it’s also an opportunity to engage thoughtfully with fellow artists\, share perspectives\, and grow together through open conversation about each other’s work. We hope you will join our supportive community! \n\n\n\n\n    more info
